        "**Reasoning**:\n",
        "As per instruction 3 of the subtask, I will redefine the `evaluate_model` function to accept a `scaler` argument (to maintain signature consistency with `train_epoch` for potential future use) and use `torch.cuda.amp.autocast()` for the forward pass and loss calculation if CUDA is available, enabling mixed-precision evaluation.\n",
